=== 3. ASYMMETRIC but REGULAR base (Frucht, cubic) ⟹ 1-WL COARSE on the base ===
     the case that separates 'key failure' from 'supply failure'
  CFI over Frucht (cubic, |Aut(base)|=1)  n=84  m=12  |E|=18  beta=7  |gauge|=128
     base: |Aut(base)|=1  degrees=[3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3]  1-WL classes=1/12 ⟹ base is COARSE under 1-WL
     cell 0 (TARGET) [gadgets] |cell|=48  gauge-orbits=12  Aut-blocks=12  ⟹ ◐ (A) every block IS one gauge-orbit, but there are 12 of them ⟹ firing is a KEY question (separate the blocks), not a supply one
     cell 1 [wires] |cell|=36  gauge-orbits=18  Aut-blocks=18  ⟹ ◐ (A) every block IS one gauge-orbit, but there are 18 of them ⟹ firing is a KEY question (separate the blocks), not a supply one
     ⟹ non-singleton cells: 2   ✅ fire-today 0   ◐ key-limited 2   ⛔ blocked 0

